Package: zoomriya-weather
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: systemd, tzdata
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: The box's weather: the forecast and alerts for the family's town
 zoomriya-weatherd fetches the forecast and the weather alerts for the town
 chosen in the first setup from the country's own weather service
 (Environment and Climate Change Canada, the US National Weather Service,
 or MET Norway elsewhere; alerts from MET Norway in Norway and EUMETNET –
 MeteoAlarm in the rest of Europe) and keeps them in
 /var/lib/zoomriya-weather/weather.json for Box Desktop and the apps to
 read. It needs nothing from the apps and fetches nothing until a town is
 chosen. Also ships the towns people choose from (GeoNames, CC BY 4.0).
